# Install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above any request.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Login as admin (role must match the account)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "kadai123", "role": "admin" }

### Token from the login above
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Wrong role for this account -> 403 ROLE_MISMATCH
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "kadai123", "role": "salesman" }

### Items
GET {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock balances (derived from the ledger)
GET {{base}}/stock/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Orders
GET {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock check, approve, invoice, dispatch (replace 1 with your ids)
GET {{base}}/orders/1/stock-check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/orders/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/orders/1/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/invoices/1/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoice PDF
GET {{base}}/invoices/1/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Record payment of Rs 4,000 against invoice 1
POST {{base}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer_id": 1, "amount_paise": 400000, "mode": "upi", "allocations": [{ "invoice_id": 1, "amount_paise": 400000 }] }

### Reports (json or csv)
GET {{base}}/reports/gst-summary?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30&format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
